== Uitleg migratie flows <section:uitleg-migratie-flows>

=== Introducite migratie flows <section:introductie-migratie-flows>

A very large proportion of migration flows can be classified as labour migration, i.e., people moving to places where they hope to find a job instead of being unemployed, or with a higher salary and better working conditions than before.

Nevertheless, migrant workers typically end up in the lower-paid and less-safe segments of the labor market in the country of destination (which may still be beneficial compared to the situation in the country of origin. Only a small fraction (about 10% in 2019) of total migration is classified as migration by refugees or asylum seekers.

