=== Migratie en sustainable development goals <section:migratie-en-sustainable-development-goals>

The 2030 Agenda for Sustainable Development by the United Nations recognizes that migration is a powerful driver of sustainable development, for migrants and their communities.

Therefore, one of the Sustainable Development Goals (SDG 10.7) explicitly targets migration policies. The stated goal is the following: “Facilitate orderly, safe, regular and responsible migration and mobility of people, including through the implementation of planned and well-managed migration policies”. To support this goal, a Global Compact for Safe, Orderly and Regular Migration was signed in 2018.

